open Neutral.B1 hiding G IsPlaceOver Dec
open NumberField IsDedekindDomain Formalism.L2.Host Formalism.ConjugateSelfDual ReciprocityTheory.Gal Formalism.BasicNotions Formalism.MainNotions.N Polynomial
